{"title":"","icon":"","img":"","tags":"","hideInMenu":"false","text":"module","cls":"Wb.Module","properties":{"cid":"module"},"_icon":"module","_expanded":true,"items":[{"_icon":"viewport","text":"viewport1","cls":"Wb.Viewport","properties":{"cid":"viewport1","html":"<html>\n  <header>\n    <title>exception page</title>\n  </header>\n  <style>\n    .lock-wrap{\n      text-align: center;\n      padding-top: 5%;\n    }\n    .lock-wrap img{\n      width:450px;\n    }\n    .lock-wrap p{\n      text-align: center;\n      margin-top: -90px;\n      color: #666;\n      font-size: 16px;\n    }\n  </style>\n  <body>\n    <div class=\"lock-wrap\">\n      <img src=\"wb/images/news_pic/lock.png\" />\n      <p>您好，您暂无权限访问该系统。咨询详情请联系系统管理员! </p>\n      \n      系统权限请联系：\n      \n      投资银行部：孔娟娟（021-38677566）\n      \t\t\t陈振宽（021-38676432）\n      \n      其他问题请联系：\n      \n      信息技术部：陈海洋（021-20992156）。\n    </div>\n  </body>\n</html>"}}]}